{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21931","headline":"云居寺孤桐 · 白居易","name":"云居寺孤桐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一株青玉立，千叶绿云委。\n亭亭五丈余，高意犹未已。\n山僧年九十，清净老不死。\n自云手种时，一棵青桐子。\n直从萌芽拔，高自毫末始。\n四面无附枝，中心有通理。\n寄言立身者，孤直当如此。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21931.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21931","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}